  <DialogueName>k__BackingField: Cornelius5
  <Text>k__BackingField: I can only draw one conclusion from this series of events.
    This <style=Engine>sky engine</style> appears to have intertwined our shared
    survival. Will you join me in saving <style=location>Hammerstead</style> and
    all that exists around it?
  <LocalizedKey>k__BackingField: LOCAL_DIALOG_KEY
  <Choices>k__BackingField:
  - <Text>k__BackingField: Of course I'll help.
    LocalizeKey: LOCAL_CHOICE_KEY
    OutputID: 
    <NextDialogue>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8850ea263efd02d4896a137a6facb0c6, type: 2}
  - <Text>k__BackingField: If I have no other choice.
    LocalizeKey: LOCAL_CHOICE_KEY
    OutputID: 
    <NextDialogue>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8850ea263efd02d4896a137a6facb0c6, type: 2}
